; 380  : // setup triple buffering, htough fail on account of memory space, when attempting to create a Third Buffer. 
; 381  : // The Primary surface and Back Buffer are then destroyed and re-created (without requiring a third buffer). If
; 382  : // Compute_SLIAA_Config has been initialized during the surface creation process before the surface creation runs out of memory,
; 383  : // the hwPtr and lfbPtr are incorrect for the primary surface and lead to corrution of the game screen (and also corruption of the 
; 384  : // desktop, if the game can be exited).
; 385  : // This fix (hack alert!!!) checks the current process name. If the process is not Re-Volt or is Re-Volt using a primary surface
