; 1640 :     /* Must flush pipeline when surface is locked, in order  */
; 1641 :     /* to process all drawing commands.  A side effect is to */
; 1642 :     /* is to flush previous swap buffer commands, which ends */
; 1643 :     /* up causing a wait on vertical retrace.  Some apps may */
; 1644 :    /* not like this behavior, but the flush is unavoidable  */
