; 1890 : 
; 1891 : #ifndef DISABLE_W2K_MAXMIPLEVEL_HACK
; 1892 :      // Fix for MipFilter Point - MaxMipLevel and
; 1893 :      //         MipFilter Linear - MaxMipLevel failures on W2K
; 1894 :      //
; 1895 :      // somehow in a 32bpp mode, Test 27 of MipFilter -point_maxmiplevel and
; 1896 :      // MipFilter -linear_maxmiplevel puts incorrect data into the 2x2 DXT2
; 1897 :      // texture on w2k
; 1898 :      //
; 1899 :      // if you just run Test 27 by itself (mipfilter -point_maxmiplevel:27),
; 1900 :      // the test passes and the data put in the 2x2 DXT2 surface
; 1901 :      // is 00FF00FFh 00000000h 000083F0h 55555050h
; 1902 :      //
; 1903 :      // but if you run test 26 and test 27 (mipfilter -point_maxmiplevel:26,27),
; 1904 :      // then the test fails and the data put in the 2x2 DXT2 surface
; 1905 :      // is 00FF00FFh 0000FF00h 0001F72Ah 55055A5Ah
; 1906 :      //
; 1907 :      // so as a total hack, detect a 2x2 DXT2 surface containing the data that
